(7475619, 1188002, 63218, '<td valign="top">The wet beach sand makes an effective mirror for your charming model. The girl, her shadow, &amp; her watery reflection all come together nicely.</td>', 'The wet beach sand makes an effective mirror for your charming model. The girl, her shadow, & her watery reflection all come together nicely.', '2016-09-25 12:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475620, 1187940, 63218, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this is ocean because of the snorkel mask. Hopefully he had a nice coral reef to swim over. The light separates him nicely from his watery BG.</td>', 'I''m thinking this is ocean because of the snorkel mask. Hopefully he had a nice coral reef to swim over. The light separates him nicely from his watery BG.', '2016-09-25 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475621, 1187985, 63218, '<td valign="top">Hate to say it but the first thing I noticed was the horizon needs levelling. The sun on the houses in the BG gives your walkers a destination. I had to search for them, in the deep shade.</td>', 'Hate to say it but the first thing I noticed was the horizon needs levelling. The sun on the houses in the BG gives your walkers a destination. I had to search for them, in the deep shade.', '2016-09-25 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475622, 1187386, 63218, '<td valign="top">Unusual, to see people walking along a highway. Makes me think maybe those BG mountains are not in North America. :D The mountains &amp; their shadows are a curious flat tone that serves well as a BG, I wonder what was the original color.</td>', 'Unusual, to see people walking along a highway. Makes me think maybe those BG mountains are not in North America. :D The mountains & their shadows are a curious flat tone that serves well as a BG, I wonder what was the original color.', '2016-09-25 12:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
