(7475635, 1187926, 63218, '<td valign="top">I feel there may be a sign somewhere nearby that says No Climbing on the Statuary. And usually a photo of a 3-dimensional artwork is not that interesting because it''s static, but by adding the human &amp; his one realistic foot you gave us an unusual moment that''s kind of fun to look at.</td>', 'I feel there may be a sign somewhere nearby that says No Climbing on the Statuary. And usually a photo of a 3-dimensional artwork is not that interesting because it''s static, but by adding the human & his one realistic foot you gave us an unusual moment that''s kind of fun to look at.', '2016-09-25 18:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475636, 1187827, 63218, '<td valign="top">...where a good time was had by all. Nuthin'' like a good Festival to make a gal laugh like a wild thing!</td>', '...where a good time was had by all. Nuthin'' like a good Festival to make a gal laugh like a wild thing!', '2016-09-25 18:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
