(7475647, 1187954, 63218, '<td valign="top">That''s another photographer you''re bravely taking a picture of, &amp; I think that''s a Canon on the chair with him. The smoky look to this took a little getting used to, but now I like it. It''s a charming &amp; strange composition, reminding me that magic &amp; mystery could be just around the next corner in my town, too. Who knows?</td>', 'That''s another photographer you''re bravely taking a picture of, & I think that''s a Canon on the chair with him. The smoky look to this took a little getting used to, but now I like it. It''s a charming & strange composition, reminding me that magic & mystery could be just around the next corner in my town, too. Who knows?', '2016-09-25 20:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
