(7476345, 1187977, 172697, '<td valign="top">Winner in every way.<br/>Great shot!<br/> <br/>There''s something I simply must share about this photo.<br/> <br/>There''s an italian scooter and motorcycles manifacturer, Piaggio, which makes a scooter called... Typhoon 50.<br/>//images.moto.it/images/316969/HOR_STD/1000x/08-typhoon-50.jpg<br/> <br/>Now, I know that those two scooters in the bottom left corner aren''t Typhoons.. but when I saw this picture and I read the title I couldn''t help but think that it might be somewhat intended.<br/> <br/>So double score for me!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-09-30 03:04:17.</i></td>', 'Winner in every way.Great shot! There''s something I simply must share about this photo. There''s an italian scooter and motorcycles manifacturer, Piaggio, which makes a scooter called... Typhoon 50.//images.moto.it/images/316969/HOR_STD/1000x/08-typhoon-50.jpg Now, I know that those two scooters in the bottom left corner aren''t Typhoons.. but when I saw this picture and I read the title I couldn''t help but think that it might be somewhat intended. So double score for me!', '2016-09-30 03:41:55.000000', '2016-09-30 04:04:17.000000', 0),
(7476346, 1187977, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Top three all got one'' so I guess we didn''t meet the challenge :-) congratulations this was always the winner , absolutely love this,  such a fantastic dynamic shot!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yup, at this point I''m starting to think that we somewhat deserved that lonely yet proud "one" :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Top three all got one'' so I guess we didn''t meet the challenge :-) congratulations this was always the winner , absolutely love this,  such a fantastic dynamic shot!!   Yup, at this point I''m starting to think that we somewhat deserved that lonely yet proud "one" :)', '2016-09-30 03:43:57.000000', NULL, 0),
