(7476397, 1187942, 140305, '<td valign="top">You''ve been away for a while! Glad to see you popping in now and again, hope it happens more often though :) Congrats on the HM.</td>', 'You''ve been away for a while! Glad to see you popping in now and again, hope it happens more often though :) Congrats on the HM.', '2016-09-30 11:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
