(7476404, 1187977, 19825, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, Georges. Such great energy and movement captured. Also, nice processing -- I can help be think I would have pushed the sharpening/saturation too far. Thanks for the lesson.</td>', 'Fantastic image, Georges. Such great energy and movement captured. Also, nice processing -- I can help be think I would have pushed the sharpening/saturation too far. Thanks for the lesson.', '2016-09-30 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 0),
