(7476443, 1187786, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markwiley:</b></div><hr/><i> You are on a nice roll. Excellent capture of an interesting character. I look forward to seeing more from you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Mark... and thanks for your feedback.<br/> <br/>I''ll try keeping it up!</td>', 'Originally posted by markwiley: You are on a nice roll. Excellent capture of an interesting character. I look forward to seeing more from you.   Thank you Mark... and thanks for your feedback. I''ll try keeping it up!', '2016-09-30 19:26:45.000000', NULL, 0),
