(7476950, 1187786, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is SO fun!<br/> <br/>And... I love your notes about "the story"!<br/> <br/>I think I would have liked it even more in BW... and definitely with less sharpening.<br/> <br/>But, I''m probably in the minority.<br/> <br/>The hat is just... amazingly wonderful!  Ha!<br/> <br/>Well done!<br/></td>', 'This is SO fun! And... I love your notes about "the story"! I think I would have liked it even more in BW... and definitely with less sharpening. But, I''m probably in the minority. The hat is just... amazingly wonderful!  Ha! Well done!', '2016-10-03 23:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
